            "card2_content": "<p>Around 67 weeks</p>",
            "card3_label": "What are the benefits?",
            "card3_content": "<ul><li>No cost to participate or receive study treatment </li><li>Regular visits with study doctors who specialize in treating HS (20 study visits) </li><li>Will receive either an investigative injection or a placebo </li></ul>",
