            "card4_content": "<ul><li>A clinical diagnosis of moderate to severe HS for at least 6 months </li><li>Have the presence of HS lesions in at least 2 distinct anatomic areas </li><li>Intolerance to oral antibiotics for HS treatment </li></ul>"
